  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Squirrel.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707053020\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Squirrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"202\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Squirrel</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 62</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4,000 to 7,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Peanuts</span><span title=\"unknown\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/peanuts-33962\" title=\"Peanuts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peanuts\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d2/Question_mark.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/27?cb=20160106150819\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  5 h</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Squirrels</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> which produce <a href=\"/wiki/peanuts-33962\" title=\"Peanuts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">peanuts</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 62. They are the seventh&#160;type of farm animal unlocked in the game.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ASquirrel.png\" title=\"Squirrel.png (182 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Squirrel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/183?cb=20200707053020\" title=\"Squirrel.png (182 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Squirrel.png (182 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASquirrel_Idle.png\" title=\"Squirrel Idle.png (179 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3e/Squirrel_Idle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/138?cb=20200707053031\" title=\"Squirrel Idle.png (179 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Squirrel Idle.png (179 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASquirrel_Storing_Nuts.png\" title=\"Squirrel Storing Nuts.png (255 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/aa/Squirrel_Storing_Nuts.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20200707052944\" title=\"Squirrel Storing Nuts.png (255 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Squirrel Storing Nuts.png (255 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASquirrel_Summer.png\" title=\"Squirrel Summer.png (260 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c0/Squirrel_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20200707051200\" title=\"Squirrel Summer.png (260 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Squirrel Summer.png (260 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASquirrel_Storing_Nuts_Winter.png\" title=\"Squirrel Storing Nuts Winter.png (268 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c0/Squirrel_Storing_Nuts_Winter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20200707052952\" title=\"Squirrel Storing Nuts Winter.png (268 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Squirrel Storing Nuts Winter.png (268 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p><p>Squirrels wear themed accessories during summer, Halloween and winter.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/27/Squirrel_House_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Squirrel house\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel house\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Squirrel house</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Squirrels must be placed in a <a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">squirrel house</a> to be purchased. The house costs 45,000 <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>. The house has room for two squirrels at first. At this point squirrels cost 4,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. The house has to grow to make room for more squirrels. Growth happen when enough peanut pods have been brought to the house by the squirrels:\n</p>\n<ul><li>When 5,500 peanut pods have been collected, a second pair of doors are added and two more squirrels can be purchased for 5,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each.</li>\n<li>At 80,000 peanut pods a third pair of doors is added and two more squirrels can be purchased for 6,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each.</li>\n<li>At 270,000 peanut pods, a fourth and last pair of doors is added and two more squirrels can be purchased for 7,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each.</li></ul>\n<p>Squirrels can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Skep.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025204403\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Skep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Skep\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Skep</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Squirrels make peanuts by scampering to <a href=\"/wiki/peanut-bush-33999\" title=\"Peanut Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">peanut bushes</a>, collecting peanut pods (one per squirrel)&#160;then scampering back to the squirrel house. It takes approximately 5&#160;hours for a pair of squirrels to collect 300 peanut pods, enough to produce one peanut, providing bushes are as close as possible to the squirrel house and there are enough bushes to get peanut pods from. Players can then collect it from the squirrel house.\n</p><p>Squirrels collect peanut pods even when players are offline (distance does not matter then)&#160;but stop doing so when a peanut is produced.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Sockeye_Salmon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150711153706\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/w